  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Apoyo al Sistema Nacional de Inversin Pblica</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for the National Public Investment System</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general del Programa es contribuir a mejorar la calidad de la inversin pblica (generar el mximo beneficio econmico y social) a fin de promover una sociedad ms solidaria, ms equitativa y ms competitiva. Especficamente, se apoyara la racionalizacin de la inversin pblica (mejor asignacin de los recursos, contemplando criterios de rentabilidad, eficiencia y equidad) y el mejoramiento de la gestin de la preinversin (racionalizacin del proceso de toma de decisiones) en el contexto de la descentralizacin administrativa y financiera del pas.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general objective of this Program is to promote further improvements in the quality of public investment (maximizing the economic and social benefits) as to promote a more solidary, equitable and competitive society. Specifically, it will contribute to rationalize public investment (better allocation of public resources, contemplating efficiency and equity criteria) and improve preinvestment management) rationalization of the decision making process) in the context of the financial and administrative decentralization.</narrative>
  </description>
